{
  "name": "dsh-bosskey",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "DSH 桌面端插件:全局 Boss 键(F9 默认,可配置),任意应用前台时一键隐藏/唤回 DeepSeek Harness 主窗口",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
